  "style": {
    "name": "warm-analogous-fruit-with-complementary-crown",
    "rationale": "Two masses in tension: a radially symmetric orange_terracotta ovoid (footing 5x5 at y0, widest 7-wide octagon at y2-4, tapering to a 3x3 shoulder at y8) reads as a fruit from every side, with a 7-tall flame of green_concrete fronds erupting on top so the silhouette is egg-below/spikes-above. yellow_terracotta studs in a staggered diamond crosshatch on all four faces give the signature pineapple lattice; sparing brown_terracotta forms a shadowed collar (y8 ring) and basal ring (y0) plus a few seam accents. Green is the complementary punch against the amber skin that makes both louder. Built in the round on a low-center-of-mass footing for turntable stability."
  },
